	(text "SHEET 05 - PCM5122 AUDIO DAC (PLAN.md sec.2)\nI2S from CM4 (GPIO18/19/21), control via I2C_CM4 @ 0x4C (ADR1=ADR2=0). MODE1/MODE2=0 -> I2C mode.\nSCK grounded: internal PLL generates the master clock from BCK (HiFiBerry-style, no external MCLK).\n2.0 VRMS ground-centered line out (VNEG charge pump) -> no output caps, no ground-loop isolator.\nXSMT: pulled up (unmuted) once 3V3_CM4 is up; RP2040 DAC_MUTE (GPIO29) can hard-mute via Q501\nduring power transitions for pop-free sequencing (PLAN.md sec.5). J501 -> stereo amp module,\nJ502 -> subwoofer amp module (module sums L+R).\nLAYOUT: keep this section away from LT8645S / USB / Ethernet / fan switching (PLAN.md sec.9)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 30 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "497750e4-23ef-56c5-a341-9b6078261e61")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
